# A designs tree that is not flow/designs.
#
# Its whole purpose is its depth: "test/designs_fixture/designs" is three
# package components where ORFS's "flow/designs" is two, and the code
# that resolves a "//" label in a config.mk has to strip exactly as many
# as the tree actually has. Stripping two unconditionally made every
# design in a deeper tree look like it had missing sources; DESIGNS came
# back empty and orfs_design() declared no targets, without a message.
#
# The designs themselves are as small as they can be. What is under test
# is discovery, not synthesis.
